 * @brief				- This function Set up flags in the callbacks of the USART Selected
 *
 * @param[HalfSelect]	- Select the Half of the ADSB Ring Buffer that is full and ready to processes
 *
 * @Note				- 	Expected use for this function in the app source.
 *
